<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\風呂.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>There was no particular progress after that, and we went straight back to the Niimura main house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I'm not in the habit of bathing several times a day, but to keep <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> company, since she missed her bath yesterday, 
{PAUSE ""}
and to wash off the dirt I'd gotten on myself underground, I was taking my first bath in 7 hours.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, once today's thirteenth-year memorial service is over, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says she's going to the police." [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> said only that much, then stayed silent, soaking in the tub.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was probably thinking over the root from earlier.<PG>
With <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> gone silent and just the two of us there, the air felt a little heavy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I thought about talking to <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> again, but I'd probably just be in her way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We did get something to reason with, so I'll copy <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and think things through too.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺幻影.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The ritual pot and tripod―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were almost the same as what I saw in last night's vision.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remember there were several pots like that underground.<PG>
That means the place in the vision probably matches the secret base too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a good place for taking out a pot and doing something in secret.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And the person I saw in the vision, too, is probably not <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> but <STYLE ID="5">Haruka's dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> doesn't know what made <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> awaken to her witch power.<PG>
If the one I saw in the vision were <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, he'd also know that <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> got covered in blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> has probably already figured out this much, too.<PG>
If <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> is still keeping silent anyway, that means there's something even more puzzling than that.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> turned toward me, her expression unchanged.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ah, I meant not to get in <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s way...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I've already called her, I'll just go ahead and ask.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The person I saw in the vision is definitely </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right. If it were </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it would contradict what we heard yesterday. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has to have been telling the truth for that to hold, though... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, nobody could have predicted you'd become able to see even things from the past. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So on this point, it wouldn't be strange for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to lie."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right, the possibility that <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> is lying, too...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So if we think it through on the assumption that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't lying―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺幻影.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ白血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Then nobody knows that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> ended up covered in blood. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, the events of the vision you saw, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, must have been, for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, 'something that would be bad if people found out.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something that would be bad if people found out...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No way. An affair or something?<PG>
No, <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> got her witch power when she was in middle school, <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> said, so that kind of thing doesn't fit...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that doesn't mean yesterday's vision was from when the two of them were in middle school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she just had two occasions to get covered in <STYLE ID="5">Ojisan</STYLE>'s blood...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, the vision I saw, was it from when the two of them were in middle school?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Probably, yes. If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had suffered an injury bad enough to cover someone in blood after he left the Arata settlement―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">that is, after he went on to high school, then </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would know about it too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Since </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">your father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't mention it yesterday, we can guess it was before he started high school."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> really is quick-witted.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So I think that was the moment </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got her witch power. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But it seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't try to hide the witch power itself, so </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the 'something that would be bad if people found out' must not have been the witch power, but the reason </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got badly hurt."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I remember right, he broke his leg hunting, and because of that <STYLE ID="5">Ojisan</STYLE> lost his confidence that he could live in Arata and left the settlement. That's what <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Dad</STYLE> also said he had a bad leg.<PG>
Besides, nobody would go hunting in a place like that,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
so if the broken leg = yesterday's vision, it means <STYLE ID="5">Ojisan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> didn't tell the real cause of the injury.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tried to hide what made him break his leg, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">If it was in middle school, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wouldn't have been allowed to go underground or take out a pot either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's no way </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who faithfully kept the rule, could have told anyone about it."</STYLE><PG>
Only if <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> isn't lying―that's the condition, but if what I saw yesterday was 'sensing danger,' then it has to lead to the curse-killings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, unless we figure out what the two of them were doing there, we can't prevent the curse-killings.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"And, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... From here on, it's pure guesswork. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I forced a lot of things that were bugging me together... so it's a bit of a wild idea..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> doesn't try to talk about things like this unless she's fairly confident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means she's put together an assumption that covers the whole picture.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Do you remember the talk about Droga?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドローガ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">was making Droga at the secret base, wasn't he?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That really was a wild idea.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A pot and a tripod, and a fire.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It certainly did look like someone making a drug.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The Arata settlement has a native variety of cherry tree. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If its roots were the raw material for Droga..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The roots are the raw material?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"More than 70 years ago, someone took the cherry trees here away, 'roots and all.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe they wanted Droga. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't think it would be strange if the method leaked outside at some point over all those years."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下4.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"And that underground space. Why do they use it to store the ritual implements? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Wasn't it a place for taking cherry roots? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺幻影.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> learned how to make Droga somehow, and put it into practice at that secret base. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It worked, but he couldn't control his own strength and got badly hurt. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Probably an open fracture of the leg."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"An open fracture... what's that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's an injury where the broken bone pierces the skin and comes out. It's also called a compound fracture. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If the broken bone damaged an artery in his leg, and the blood that spurted out got on </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><PG>
That would certainly add up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, a broken bone sticking out through the skin... It hurts just to imagine it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"And this is an even shakier guess... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe if you get covered in the blood of someone who used Droga..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm, at this point it's pretty hard to call it even a guess...<PG>
But it definitely is something I have in common with <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Get covered in <STYLE ID="5">Ojisan</STYLE>'s blood, and you gain the witch power―precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the trait that applies only to <STYLE ID="5">Ojisan</STYLE> is having used Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one element connecting two people with no ties at all: me and <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
No, wait a minute...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then who on earth made the Droga that was sent to Megasawa City...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, was the one who sent the Droga to </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, that contradicts her trying to make </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> give up the murder. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So if </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> made Droga, and because of that someone else learned how to make it and tried to experiment with it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That would be limited to people in the Arata settlement who were of a certain age back then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Even <STYLE ID="10">Chiga-nee</STYLE> knew about Droga, so the people of the settlement must have known it existed, even if they didn't know how to make it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The Niimura main house's cherry tree is probably failing not so much from old age as because too many of its roots were taken to use as raw material for Droga. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There were cobwebs on those iron bars earlier, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Only around the door were there hardly any cobwebs. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That means someone has been going in and out often, even after it was put off-limits."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s theory is, unusually for her, quite a stretch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even so, things connect up so well it's creepy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But unfortunately, no matter what, it doesn't connect all the way to the curse-killings.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, does the Droga stuff connect to the curse-killings...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
