{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I said that, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> looked down and fell into thought again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She kept making small nodding motions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was probably going over her own ideas again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I think Droga has practically no connection at all to the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If there's any at all, it's only that it led to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s death. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got help from her in Megasawa, and all because of that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No connection at all... um, meaning what?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"In terms of 'kishotenketsu,' </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s death is the 'setup.' [TN: Kishotenketsu: four parts, ki 'setup', sho 'development', ten 'twist', ketsu 'conclusion'.] </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, that's not right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> having her head cut off is the 'setup.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Someone is definitely lying about this."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"When you say lying...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"First, as things stand, I can think of three possibilities. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The first is the case where what led </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to gain her witch power was something </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> actually knew. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, as I said at the start, every guess so far is wrong. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> actually cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head, then he hated the settlement's rule, or the settlement itself, and staged curse-killings to cause the whole series of incidents."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The second is if </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was lying. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That would mean she saw something to do with the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The reason would be that she doesn't want to hand the people of the settlement over to the police, but that's a contradiction. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is going to consult the police once the thirteenth-year memorial service is over, isn't she?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">If she were hiding something, she wouldn't need to do that, and she wouldn't want to talk to us about the curse-killings in the first place."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The third is if </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was lying. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s wife was killed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is lying, then his wife's killing has nothing at all to do with </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s death. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">For example, maybe </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> killed her by accident at the end of a marital fight. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> went out of his way to give </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the cherry branch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I can't see him doing something that risky, something that could expose his crime."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So we've come full circle, and it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> who's lying after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's possible too, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if so, something's off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> telling the truth is the case that fits the situation better. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> couldn't have known about </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> vision, and it doesn't contradict that at all either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> paused a little, then took a slow, deep breath.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So if it's possible at all, the culprit is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">No, there's more than one mastermind. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What's more, even without being aware of each other, they can each grasp what their accomplice wants."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............??
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............???
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't really get what she's saying...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, explain, please..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, I put that in a difficult way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If the stories don't contradict each other, there's probably more than one culprit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's because they can get their stories straight with each other. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But in this case, I don't think the culprits have gotten their stories straight. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because there's an eerie lack of lies. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone is telling nothing but the truth. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Except for one thing..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Only one lie?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I think it's probably that someone who knows how </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head came to be cut off is pretending not to know."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体首なし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The first to find her was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so '</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head had been cut off where she fell' is probably the lie. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That way, no matter how much he lies, there's no way to check it."</STYLE><PG>
Then <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> is the culprit after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But from how <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> looked, she didn't seem to think so either.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"There must have been at least one more witness to the beheading. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Whether that's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, or someone else, I don't know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, the reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head was cut off must not get out: that's the one understanding </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the other mastermind share. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That alone is what's driving all the curse-killings."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> isn't necessarily the culprit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> only knows how </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head came to be cut off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Whether he carried out the beheading himself doesn't matter much, I think. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Why her head was cut off, and who the other person who witnessed it is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If we figure that out, I think it'll lead to preventing the curse-killings."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Who could it be...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"From here on, I think it comes down to the emotional side of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the other person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I can't take the reasoning any further. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What I said yesterday, 'there being no culprit is the background,' I'll correct to 'there's no culprit pulling all the strings.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Also... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, do you know this story?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\井戸.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"One day, I killed my little sister because her crying got on my nerves, and threw the body down the well. When I went to look the next day, the body had vanished.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">5 years later, I killed a friend over a trivial fight, and threw the body down the well. When I went to look the next day, the body had vanished.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">10 years later, I killed a woman I'd gotten pregnant in a drunken moment, and threw the body down the well. When I went to look the next day, the body had vanished.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">15 years later, I killed a boss I hated, and threw the body down the well. When I went to look the next day, the body had vanished."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"20 years later, I killed my mother because she needed nursing care and was in the way, and threw the body down the well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When I went to look the next day, the body had 'not' vanished. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The next day, and the next, the body stayed where it was― </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is one of those 'scary once you get it' stories you often see online."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, I've heard that one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If I remember right, the mother hid the bodies thrown down the well somewhere else, somewhere hard to find, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　So nobody would find out about her son's crimes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Right. In this mother and son's case, even though they never got their stories straight, their interests lined up, and that's why this happened. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I think this case is similar."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Meaning </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> plays the mother?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, it's not necessarily </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> who caused the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Like in that example, their interests lined up emotionally, so they were able to carry out the curse-killings without exchanging a word. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's why nobody's stories contradict each other. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because at least one mastermind doesn't know what the other accomplice did. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You can't lie about something you don't know."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, this is complicated... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Um, in terms of that example,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">the body in the well = the reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s head was cut off</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">the son = one of the masterminds</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">the mother = the other mastermind</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Is that about right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"If there are two masterminds, that's correct. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What drives the curse-killings is strictly the emotional side. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And that relates to the affair of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s beheading. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">While we're at it, think of the string of suicides and the reason people die in April as completely unnecessary information―misdirection."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"All of it misdirection..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. All the reasoning up to now gets reset."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Got it. Then... um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">what should we do from here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Since even the masterminds may not know everything, there's no telling what moves they'll make from here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">They act for the emotional interests the masterminds share. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">preventing it is extremely difficult. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The only thing we can rely on is... um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't mean to pressure you, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> intuition, and nothing else..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'll do my best! After all, I've got nerves of steel!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"All I can do is put forward this hypothesis with no clear basis. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The rest... I'm leaving to you."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> did everything she could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was pretty hard to follow, and I'm not confident I understood all of it, but one thing I can say is that it depends on my intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A little more... I feel like in just a little more, the truth will come into view.
